OL,3,GNEWSADisruption after 400 litre lorry
OL,4,Afuel leak on road
OL,5,
OL,6,FA road has shut in Stoke-in-Trent after
OL,7,Fa lorry leaked around 400 litres of
OL,8,Ffuel onto the road.
OL,10,FPolice were called to Anchor Road, in
OL,11,FLongton on Saturday morning, where fuel
OL,12,Fhas leaked on to a one-mile stretch,
OL,13,Ffrom the town centre to the Army
OL,14,FReserves Centre.
OL,16,FStaffordshire Police said it was
OL,17,Fworking with the fire service and
OL,18,Fhighways to clear the road surface -
OL,19,Fwhich is expected to take a "many"
OL,20,Fhours.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
